{"ID":"20240220132600-dxgskv4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132600-dxgskv4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132600-dxgskv4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172003-bhqksgr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172003-es4kwjb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172003-es4kwjb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"【当归四逆加吴茱萸生姜汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312172003"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312172003-bhqksgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172003-bhqksgr","updated":"20240312172003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百六十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172003-375zf0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172003-375zf0x","updated":"20240312172003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：若其人内有久寒者，宜「当归四逆加吴茱萸生姜汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172003-3ys6522","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172003-3ys6522","updated":"20240312172003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床看肝病的人恶心呕吐，用吴茱萸止呕，吴茱萸能够入肝。临床遇到胃下垂，几乎一剂就去掉了。一剂药煮成三碗水，第一碗就好掉一大半了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172003-2p2a4cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172003-2p2a4cx","updated":"20240312172003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人常常胃里面很寒，不能吃凉的，一吃凉的恶心不消化，不是吐就是下痢。手脚都是冰冷的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手脚的温度就代表胃气的温度"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172003-r200usp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172003-r200usp","updated":"20240312172003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常人手掌是热的，手背是凉的，手掌的热度要到手指头尖才刚刚好。头是凉的，手掌是热的。因为胃气会往上升。手脚温度是平衡的，胃气没有发汗，身体里面很热的话，热就会找地方发散，会发头上，头上是热的。摸到头是热的，手是冷的身体也是有问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172003-u3aitiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172003-u3aitiy","updated":"20240312172003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归四逆加吴茱萸生姜汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172003-xuegfg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172003-xuegfg1","updated":"20240312172003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归三两。桂枝三两。芍药三两。细辛三两。通草二两。甘草二两炙。大枣二十五枚。吴茱萸二升。生姜半斤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172003-es4kwjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172003-es4kwjb","updated":"20240312172003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右九味，以水六升。清酒六升，和煮取五升，去滓，分温五服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]}]}